        "text": "Six lines, about 06:00 to midnight. A 2-hour ticket is SR 4; 3-day pass about SR 20, 7-day SR 40, 30-day SR 140. Tickets include Riyadh Bus."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Riyadh Bus is the main city bus network; fares start around SR 4. Covered by metro passes."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Metered taxis in town usually under SR 30. Uber and Careem work well; many locals agree flat fares of SR 10–15 for short hops."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Driving is the local norm and roads are wide. Check whether your licence needs an International Driving Permit."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Hard in the spread-out north; easy and rewarding in Al-Bathaa's old alleys. Avoid midday heat in summer."
      }
